    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1832" root="بحثر" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَبَنٌ مُبَحْثِرٌ</span></b>  <i>Milk curdling,</i> or <i>coagulating, and
forming little clots of curd.</i> (K. [See Q. 1.])
When the upper portion is thick and the lower
thin, it is termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَادِرٌ</span>. (TA.)

